                  "Text": "This soil file is the master soil file  for farming systems project \n\nlat modified 7/2/2020 Jeremy whish \n\ndul and ll added from lowest and maximum data found in 2019 and 2020 sampling\n\nlast updated 8/8/2020 adjustment to lower limit and DUL based on full sampling of all plots layer structure and depth changed to match field ex sampling reduced to 2m \nAll crops have the wheat lowerlimit except mungbeans wheat to 60 then half wheat, then quarter wheat, then 0\nKL Values from apsoil protocol and all soil values from protocol.\n\n30/9/2020  organic carbon finert and fbiom set to apsim standard values\n\noriginal ph\n7.200\n7.500\n7.600\n8.000\n8.000\n8.000",
                  "Name": "memo",
